WEBVTT

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:48.780
One calamari, ready to go!

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:50.210
Looks delicious!

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:52.220
You wanted a Deluxe, right?

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:53.340
Give us two!

00:01:58.230 --> 00:01:59.420
Jumping the bill!

00:01:59.530 --> 00:02:00.960
Which way did he go!?

00:02:06.130 --> 00:02:10.500
What a dope! That okonomiyaki
was only half-cooked!

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:17.940
Shampoo, won't you
go out with me today?

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:20.870
I busy delivering food now!

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:24.380
Then go out with me
after your deliveries?

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:27.250
After, I go on date with Ranma.

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:28.820
But...

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:34.290
Who goes there!?

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:38.760
My ramen been stolen!

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:40.730
Why you...!
Return that ramen!

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:43.000
Mousse!

00:02:49.340 --> 00:02:53.110
They so fast!
What people is that?

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:10.690
A rash of food thefts?

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:11.760
That's right.

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:16.740
In the last few days, many local
restaurants have been targeted.

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:19.200
While Shampoo was
making a delivery...

00:03:19.310 --> 00:03:20.300
She was robbed!?

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:24.340
I so scared, Ranma!
You avenge Shampoo?

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:28.780
Ranma's gonna defend MY honor.
Right, Ranma-honey?

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:34.750
Anyway, if such horrible people
are running loose in town...

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:37.620
...we certainly can't ignore it.

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:39.580
I see.

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:44.600
We must gather the Dojo's might
to bring the culprits to justice.

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:46.030
Dad...

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:48.300
Akane. Welcome home.

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:49.460
Did you hear us talking?

00:03:49.570 --> 00:03:50.800
What'll I do?

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:55.540
I was planning to go away with
my friends for the weekend.

00:03:55.840 --> 00:04:00.970
I can handle freeloadin'
food thieves by myself.

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:04.510
You're saying
I'd be in your way!?

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:08.620
All I said was,
I can fight my own fights.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:12.920
Akane can no handle
them food thieves!

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:15.550
She's right.
Just let Ranma handle this.

00:04:15.660 --> 00:04:19.430
Go ahead 'n' run
along on your trip.

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:21.800
I see!

00:04:24.270 --> 00:04:26.170
A CAT!

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:30.070
Dad, I'm going to help, too!

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:33.510
It's a martial artist's duty
to protect the town's peace!

00:04:33.610 --> 00:04:37.140
I'll make sure these
thieves are caught!

00:04:37.650 --> 00:04:40.120
I'm gonna cancel my trip!

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:45.850
I don't want to
overstay my welcome.

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:48.420
Oh, are you leaving so soon?

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:53.500
Be careful when you
encounter these thieves.

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:58.800
I have the feeling that normal
means will not be effective here.

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:13.420
What's with Akane?

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:16.280
She should just let
me handle the bad guys.

00:05:16.390 --> 00:05:20.420
Capturing these criminals may be
more difficult than you think.

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:21.390
What'd you say!?

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:24.490
Be quiet and listen
to what I have to say.

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:29.360
Ranma Saotome!
I am here to warn...

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:35.140
What was that?

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:38.770
Pigtailed girl!
How I've longed for you!

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:41.710
Where'd you come from!?

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:43.610
G-Gimme back m-my...

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:46.610
M-My p-pineapples...

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:49.750
Ryoga, you too!?

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:52.050
What?

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:55.990
You tellin' me you all got
robbed by the same crooks?

00:05:56.200 --> 00:06:01.400
I was en route with some
Hokkaido pineapples for Akane...

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:05.930
I was anticipating my deluxe
unagi bento during practice.

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:07.840
They caught me
with my guard down.

00:06:07.940 --> 00:06:09.970
You are so pathetic.

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:11.940
I don't need that from you!

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:16.980
Perhaps, but the thieves'
speed was beyond human.

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:21.340
He consumed my teriyaki eels
and rice in a mere four seconds!

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:24.020
What? My pineapples were
gone in three seconds!

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:27.460
Well, Shampoo's ramen was
gone in two-point-five seconds!

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:32.760
Geez! So you guys have no idea
what these thieves look like?

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:35.830
I have but one warning for you:

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:38.700
Don't underestimate these thieves.

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:43.500
They're unlike anyone you've
ever fought. Prepare yourself.

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:54.680
Miss, could you bring us
some more nori rice cakes?

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:56.090
Dad!

00:06:56.190 --> 00:06:59.220
Weren't we supposed to be
staking out the food thieves?

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:01.490
Don't you understand, Akane?

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:07.530
We pretend to be customers,
and wait for the thieves to show.

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:10.130
I'm going home.

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:12.740
Wait, Akane.

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:15.040
Here.

00:07:16.180 --> 00:07:18.540
This is a gift
for Kasumi and Nabiki.

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:27.050
Does Dad want to catch
those thieves or not?

00:07:36.460 --> 00:07:37.230
Who's there!?

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:39.130
It's FOOD!

00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:40.560
Hey, Kurumi!

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:41.930
Stop that base behavior!

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:46.530
But it smells so good!

00:07:46.640 --> 00:07:48.470
I told you to stop!

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:52.430
If you want it, it's yours.

00:07:52.550 --> 00:07:55.280
Really? Is it okay?

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:58.320
Okay!

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:06.750
Thank you.
I appreciate your kindness.

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:09.300
Hey! Thank the nice lady!

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:11.730
Thank you. It was delicious!

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:16.090
Th-Think nothing of it.
I gotta go. Bye!

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:19.970
Wow, that kid
must've been starving!

00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:31.210
Why are those girls following me?

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:40.720
I'm sorry, I don't have
time for games today!

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:48.890
Akane, welcome home!

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:53.800
I made it home. I've lost 'em...

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:57.000
So you brought your
friends home, Akane?

00:09:00.550 --> 00:09:02.740
No way...

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:12.180
Please help yourself.
Have as many as you like.

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:13.950
Don't make a fuss
on our account.

00:09:14.060 --> 00:09:16.090
Then I'll help myself!

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:17.360
We're back.

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:18.560
Visitors?

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:19.690
Welcome!

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:21.770
Sorry to intrude.

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:26.700
What proper manners. Same age
as Akane, but worlds apart.

00:09:26.810 --> 00:09:27.800
Excuse me!

00:09:27.910 --> 00:09:29.740
Miss Akane!

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:35.240
We were rude for not
introducing ourselves.

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:40.250
My name is Natsume.

00:09:41.020 --> 00:09:46.890
My sister Kurumi and I have
been traveling all over Japan.

00:09:46.990 --> 00:09:51.490
We've been searching for our
father who's in training.

00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:58.100
Our money ran out, and Kurumi
began eating other people's food...

00:09:58.210 --> 00:10:03.270
...in order to fill her endless
appetite. It's very troubling.

00:10:04.610 --> 00:10:07.710
Then you're the thieves
who've been jumpin' the bills!

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:15.350
Yet, Miss Akane showed charity
even to lowly waifs like us.

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:20.390
We must repay her kindness.
That is why we've come.

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:24.690
It's okay!
Don't worry about it!

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:27.330
But we must pay you back somehow!

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:30.400
I don't know how to take this.

00:10:30.800 --> 00:10:32.970
Just take it, Akane!

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:36.940
I'm sure it's difficult
living on wits alone.

00:10:37.480 --> 00:10:39.880
Why not stay with us a while?

00:10:39.980 --> 00:10:40.710
Really, sir!?

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:42.710
Thank you!

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:46.380
I'd say this case is closed!
A happy ending!

00:10:46.490 --> 00:10:50.290
When we're involved, it always
ends happily! Right, Tendo?

00:10:50.390 --> 00:10:52.720
Saotome. You're so laid-back.

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:54.790
Pay me for those rice cakes.

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:56.890
Then you'll be so paid-back.

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:02.800
Wow! So you're in
martial arts training, too!

00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:05.570
Yep. We made a promise.

00:11:05.670 --> 00:11:09.770
Someday, we'll be great martial
artists, just like our father!

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:11.310
Your father?

00:11:11.410 --> 00:11:14.940
Our father is a very
powerful martial artist.

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:17.810
His punches could tear the heavens.

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:20.550
His kicks shake the very Earth!

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:23.520
He's the best! A king of kings!

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:26.780
We're separated now...

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:32.590
but he's somewhere,
ready to protect us.

00:11:32.700 --> 00:11:35.500
We believe in him,
and work hard every day.

00:11:37.070 --> 00:11:38.440
That's it exactly, Kurumi!

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:39.530
Natsume!

00:11:39.910 --> 00:11:43.270
Hey, you two!
We've got a dojo here.

00:11:43.780 --> 00:11:45.300
Why don't we have a match?

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:47.540
But...

00:11:47.650 --> 00:11:51.340
I want to see how good
you two are. Please?

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:53.310
All right.

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:57.450
Since you ask it of us, Akane,
we'll gladly spar with you.

00:11:57.560 --> 00:11:58.750
Right, Kurumi?

00:11:59.890 --> 00:12:02.090
Yes... Ma'am.

00:12:07.930 --> 00:12:10.230
Tendo Dojo

00:12:12.570 --> 00:12:15.170
This ain't such a good idea.

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:16.500
What do you mean by that!?

00:12:16.980 --> 00:12:21.880
You've only been joggin' lately.
Fight now, and you'll get hurt.

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:25.880
Shut up! We're not
fighting for real, okay!?

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:28.880
Akane, are you sure
you want to do this?

00:12:29.620 --> 00:12:32.250
I'm fine! Really, I'm okay!

00:12:32.360 --> 00:12:34.420
All right, here I come.

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:49.600
I can't touch her!
Is she reading my moves?

00:12:57.780 --> 00:12:59.180
Look out, Akane!

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:12.730
I'm sorry, Akane! I threw
you so suddenly. Did it hurt?

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:15.030
No, not at all!

00:13:17.800 --> 00:13:19.290
I was no match for her.

00:13:19.970 --> 00:13:22.310
I told you it
wasn't a good idea.

00:13:22.910 --> 00:13:28.040
To thank you for sparring with me,
I'll cook you dinner!

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:30.640
Really!?

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:32.240
How wonderful, Kurumi!

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:34.880
Just leave it to me!

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:39.420
Everyone! Time for dinner!

00:13:39.530 --> 00:13:41.290
Okay!

00:13:45.030 --> 00:13:48.160
It couldn't be that this food...

00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:52.300
Right. Akane made half
of tonight's dinner!

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:56.880
She was so excited to
be cooking for guests...

00:13:57.910 --> 00:14:00.540
Gee, I'm not feelin' that well...

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:05.520
You're not getting away!
This is my specialty. Dig in.

00:14:05.950 --> 00:14:06.940
Thank you.

00:14:07.050 --> 00:14:08.820
Thank you!

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:11.580
N-No! You fools! You'll die!

00:14:14.530 --> 00:14:15.960
S-She's eating it.

00:14:16.060 --> 00:14:18.530
And she's still alive...

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:23.390
It's good! Can I have some more?

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:28.470
Really!? I'm so happy! Have
all you like! There's plenty!

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:30.700
Isn't that nice, Akane?

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:33.300
She must have been
desperate for food.

00:14:33.410 --> 00:14:39.410
No, the endless life of hunger
turns your stomach to cast-iron.

00:14:39.750 --> 00:14:43.550
T-There's more to them
than meets the eye.

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:46.460
It was delicious!

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:48.960
Not at all.

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:53.460
Kurumi! So you and Akane had
a match today. How'd it go?

00:14:53.600 --> 00:14:55.230
Well...

00:14:55.340 --> 00:14:56.890
She was a pushover, right?

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:58.490
Nabiki!

00:14:58.770 --> 00:15:05.040
Akane only does martial arts
to avoid dieting, these days.

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:09.510
The heir to the Anything-Goes
School of Martial Arts is useless.

00:15:09.920 --> 00:15:11.510
"Anything-Goes Martial Arts"!?

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:14.440
What's wrong, you two?
You look a little pale.

00:15:14.590 --> 00:15:17.180
Our one and only goal is...

00:15:17.290 --> 00:15:20.260
...to be the best in Anything-
Goes Female Martial Arts!

00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:22.050
"Be the best..."

00:15:22.160 --> 00:15:23.890
"...in Anything-Goes
Female Martial Arts"...!?

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:25.330
Impossible!

00:15:25.430 --> 00:15:30.560
Anything-Goes only has two
schools: Tendo and Saotome!

00:15:31.100 --> 00:15:33.040
Our father said this:

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:36.300
"When you become
true martial artists...

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:39.280
"You will inherit the Anything-
Goes School of Martial Arts."

00:15:39.550 --> 00:15:42.070
What's your father's name?

00:15:42.550 --> 00:15:43.380
It's Tendo...

00:15:43.450 --> 00:15:44.780
...Soun!

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:54.290
I'm Soun Tendo.

00:15:55.630 --> 00:15:57.820
Then that was you!

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:01.160
You're our father!

00:16:02.070 --> 00:16:02.930
Father!

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:04.940
How we've missed you!

00:16:05.370 --> 00:16:07.570
Father... No!

00:16:09.180 --> 00:16:11.940
You've got life in you yet, Daddy.

00:16:12.480 --> 00:16:14.910
What is going on here, Dad!?

00:16:15.480 --> 00:16:19.110
I don't know! I don't remember
fathering illegitimate children!

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:22.920
Do you have any proof
that I'm your father!?

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:25.090
I have proof right here.

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:27.390
That's my father.

00:16:28.230 --> 00:16:31.060
This man with his
back to the camera?

00:16:31.160 --> 00:16:34.160
It all happened ten years ago...

00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:39.040
My sister and I were practicing
in the mountains one day...

00:16:43.910 --> 00:16:45.610
Natsume!

00:16:51.790 --> 00:16:53.750
Are you two girls all right?

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:55.450
Thank you!

00:16:56.090 --> 00:16:59.120
And suddenly we had this feeling!

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:02.960
This stranger must be
our own beloved father!

00:17:04.030 --> 00:17:05.430
Then he said...

00:17:05.530 --> 00:17:08.430
When you become
true martial artists...

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:11.230
You will inherit the Anything-
Goes School of Martial Arts.

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:15.570
I never dreamed we'd
be reunited like this!

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:17.400
Are you sure
you don't remember this?

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:21.500
Look deep into your heart and
see if you can't recall, Tendo.

00:17:21.780 --> 00:17:25.480
Saotome!
I don't need you to prod me!

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:29.890
But one snapshot
don't prove nothin'.

00:17:29.990 --> 00:17:33.020
That's right!
You can't even see his face!

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:36.960
And it's a childhood memory.
There must be some mistake.

00:17:37.060 --> 00:17:40.730
Good of you to realize it!
Great! You're smart! Smart!

00:17:41.230 --> 00:17:42.790
No! There's no mistake.

00:17:43.470 --> 00:17:45.730
The promise was signed on the back.

00:17:45.840 --> 00:17:49.900
"You'll inherit the Anything-
Goes School when you get big.

00:17:50.010 --> 00:17:52.270
Your Pops, Soun Tendo."

00:17:54.150 --> 00:17:55.380
That's that.

00:17:55.480 --> 00:17:57.470
Daddy's writing was sloppy then, too.

00:17:57.580 --> 00:17:59.810
Oh, my. It is true.

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:02.580
You really are our Papa!

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:08.060
I don't know them! Truly I don't!
Kasumi! Nabiki! Believe me!

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:10.030
Oh, Father!

00:18:10.260 --> 00:18:12.460
This can't be...

00:18:13.330 --> 00:18:16.430
Why don't you legally recognize
them as your daughters, Tendo?

00:18:16.540 --> 00:18:19.100
Don't talk baloney, Saotome!

00:18:19.210 --> 00:18:20.930
They're good kids.

00:18:27.050 --> 00:18:29.740
That's a good
early workout, Akane.

00:18:29.850 --> 00:18:31.370
Good morning, Father.

00:18:32.150 --> 00:18:34.310
Your breakfast has been prepared.

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:35.410
All right.

00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:41.120
Wh-What is this!?

00:18:41.230 --> 00:18:45.100
They insisted on making your
breakfast personally, Father.

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:48.900
The head of the household
must receive proper nutrition!

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:51.200
Say "Ahh..."

00:18:52.370 --> 00:18:55.140
Papa! Have some of this, too!

00:18:57.310 --> 00:18:58.870
Look at the way they treat him!

00:18:58.980 --> 00:19:01.170
I envy you, Tendo.

00:19:04.480 --> 00:19:06.580
I can't take this heavy food!

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:08.850
But talk about luxury!

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:13.520
Happiness is two daughters
tending to your every whim!

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:15.090
But...

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:16.220
Papa!

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:19.660
Mr. Saotome! Let me
give you a backrub!

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:20.890
Thank you.

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:22.470
You're so tense!

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:24.760
This is heaven.

00:19:27.110 --> 00:19:29.170
I've brought you your paper, Father!

00:19:29.280 --> 00:19:30.140
Thank you.

00:19:30.240 --> 00:19:32.580
Papa, I've made you some tea!

00:19:32.680 --> 00:19:34.110
So considerate...

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:37.010
Father, your lunch is ready.

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:41.020
Papa, I've bought you some
bean-filled rice cakes!

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:42.550
Thanks.

00:19:45.790 --> 00:19:46.780
I can't take it...

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:50.020
Tendo, you really don't remember?

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:55.730
Saotome, I'm not that virile!
I couldn't have done it!

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:56.530
Father!

00:19:56.640 --> 00:19:58.600
Mr. Saotome!

00:19:59.970 --> 00:20:02.500
Allow me to wash your back.

00:20:02.610 --> 00:20:06.170
No! Young girls shouldn't be in
the bathroom with grown men...

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:09.210
Your back is so big, Mr. Saotome!

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:11.780
Thanks for all your help!

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:15.580
Don't you think
they're overdoing it!?

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:19.450
Dad and Mr. Saotome! Flatter
them a little and they melt!

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:21.320
I've never seen
anything so disgusting!

00:20:21.430 --> 00:20:25.660
But they're saving us the
trouble of taking care of Daddy!

00:20:25.770 --> 00:20:31.760
Natsume and Kurumi have never
known the joys of family life.

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:35.160
Perhaps a little
tolerance is in order.

00:20:35.280 --> 00:20:36.570
Maybe...

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:40.480
Father! Mr. Saotome!
Here's your beer.

00:20:41.210 --> 00:20:45.780
Tendo, nowadays such obedient
children are hard to come by!

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:50.380
All I've got is that
ingrate son of mine.

00:20:50.490 --> 00:20:53.080
I'm so jealous!

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:55.590
Let's just let these
girls have the Dojo.

00:20:55.700 --> 00:20:59.760
Then we could just sit
back and enjoy the good li...

00:21:00.470 --> 00:21:04.700
Mr. Saotome, don't give
Dad any dumb ideas.

00:21:04.800 --> 00:21:09.260
Akane, what Mr. Saotome
says is the proper opinion.

00:21:09.380 --> 00:21:10.270
What!?

00:21:10.380 --> 00:21:13.970
Anything-Goes Martial Arts is
passed down through generations.

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:19.210
Only the best fighter in the
family should learn its secrets.

00:21:19.320 --> 00:21:25.260
I'm saying that we are the more
appropriate heirs, not you.

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:27.620
Natsume!

00:21:27.730 --> 00:21:31.290
So you're saying
you're stronger than me?

00:21:31.460 --> 00:21:32.950
Shall we find out?

00:21:33.070 --> 00:21:34.530
I'm looking forward to it!

00:21:34.630 --> 00:21:36.300
Now wait, both of you!

00:21:36.400 --> 00:21:38.170
Hold it right there!

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:42.170
I, Ranma Saotome,
accept that challenge!

00:21:42.580 --> 00:21:47.010
Ranma! Don't make this any
worse than it already is!

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:49.810
That's right! This is MY fight!

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:51.410
It's fine with me.

00:21:51.520 --> 00:21:56.920
I don't know who you are, but
we can fight two-on-two.

00:21:57.060 --> 00:22:00.320
It's a match! For the position
of heir to the Tendo Dojo!

00:22:02.100 --> 00:22:06.160
Good idea! I don't
care what's on the line...

00:22:06.270 --> 00:22:10.000
Ranma! What have you done!?
What if you lose!?

00:22:10.100 --> 00:22:12.800
Don't worry.
I'm gonna win, easy!

00:22:16.210 --> 00:22:18.040
Why aren't you fighting as a boy?

00:22:18.140 --> 00:22:21.310
A guy can't go full power
when he's fightin' girls!

00:22:21.410 --> 00:22:23.810
Don't hold back, Kurumi!

00:22:24.450 --> 00:22:26.350
Why is this happening!?

00:22:26.450 --> 00:22:28.350
It's probably fate.

00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:30.980
Don't hurt each other, all right?

00:22:31.090 --> 00:22:32.420
Let it begin!

00:22:33.390 --> 00:22:36.290
I'm gonna finish this in one blow!

00:22:36.630 --> 00:22:38.820
Ranma!

00:22:40.030 --> 00:22:43.630
What's with that ribbon!?
It feels like it's on fire!

00:22:43.740 --> 00:22:44.960
Ranma, are you okay?

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:49.300
Hey, stupid! Don't worry
about me! Open your eyes!

00:22:52.580 --> 00:22:55.810
That blow felt so cold!
Like a razor-sharp wind!

00:22:58.150 --> 00:23:00.350
Akane!

00:23:03.120 --> 00:23:04.920
You idiot!
Watch your opponent!

00:23:05.020 --> 00:23:08.690
Leave me alone! I'm a
martial artist too, you know!

00:23:08.800 --> 00:23:12.530
Don't go puttin' on airs!
Just let me handle this!

00:23:12.630 --> 00:23:14.730
It's my duty to protect the Dojo!

00:23:16.300 --> 00:23:20.400
Listen to those two.
This is no time for an argument.

00:23:20.510 --> 00:23:22.340
Kurumi! Now.

00:23:22.440 --> 00:23:24.210
O-Okay...

00:23:24.810 --> 00:23:25.470
What?

00:23:25.580 --> 00:23:26.410
Oh, no!

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:31.510
Anything-Goes Secret Attack!
Ring of Dragon Fire!

00:23:40.660 --> 00:23:44.860
I went easy on them.
Their lives should be in no danger.

00:23:44.960 --> 00:23:47.900
We've left no
questions unanswered.

00:23:55.410 --> 00:23:57.600
Ranma! Hey, Ranma!

00:23:59.480 --> 00:24:03.710
If you weren't here,
I coulda won that fight easy!

00:24:04.420 --> 00:24:06.610
And I...

00:24:10.460 --> 00:24:12.650
Fine!

00:24:13.360 --> 00:24:17.020
If I'm in your way so much...

00:24:17.560 --> 00:24:19.760
Then...

00:24:21.930 --> 00:24:22.870
Uh-oh.

00:24:22.970 --> 00:24:25.160
Oh, my.

00:24:26.270 --> 00:24:28.470
Akane!

00:24:30.510 --> 00:24:32.710
Ranma!

00:24:34.350 --> 00:24:36.750
This is your responsibility!

00:24:38.480 --> 00:24:43.680
Until you come back with Akane,
don't set foot inside this door!

00:24:47.690 --> 00:24:52.190
I'll show you! I'll win back
the Tendo Dojo by myself!

00:25:03.310 --> 00:25:06.710
The Tendo Dojo is now ours.

00:25:06.810 --> 00:25:11.010
Our long days of living like
gypsies are finally over.

00:25:12.250 --> 00:25:14.450
Akane...

00:25:16.520 --> 00:25:18.720
Ranma...

00:25:19.360 --> 00:25:21.550
Ranma, you fool!
